## Status legend

```yaml
status_codes:
  REAL:         "Implemented, tested, production-usable"
  PARTIAL:      "Implemented but not fully verified or connected"
  SKELETON:     "Struct/interface defined, computation not implemented"
  STUB:         "Returns hardcoded/default value silently"
  STUB_PARTIAL: "Partially real but key path is still stub"
  WRONG:        "Exists but produces incorrect output (e.g. ASCII != BPE)"
  MISSING:      "File or directory does not exist"
```

